    "body": "> I think for our use case we'd need basically the entire chain of API calls to be synchronous\r\n\r\nYup, this is what I had suspected :)\r\n\r\n[JSPI](https://chromestatus.com/feature/5674874568704000) is currently in Dev Trial and is going into Origin Trial in M123 in Chrome. I would recommend checking it out!",
